<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>小便不痛 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%B0%8F%E4%BE%BF%E4%B8%8D%E7%97%9B/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mtcmp1fx</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 11:08:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%B0%8F%E4%BE%BF%E4%B8%8D%E7%97%9B/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>末治法：论大便不痛 小便不痛 疟症不已 产妇感中风邪</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-9-mozhifa/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 11:06:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-9-mozhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B9%90%E9%9B%86/">卷二乐集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“末治法”部分，论述&lt;strong&gt;六腑及久病虚证&lt;/strong&gt;的调治原则。核心思想是：对于&lt;strong&gt;久病正虚、腑气不通、疟疾缠绵、产后中风&lt;/strong&gt;等症，不可急于攻邪通利，而应&lt;strong&gt;以补益气血阴阳为本，略佐祛邪疏导之品为末&lt;/strong&gt;，使正气复而邪自退、腑自通。</description></item></channel></rss>